The MIT license above covers the emulator and its test programs.

It does NOT cover the vendored DOOM engine source under programs/doom/, which
is derived from id Software's DOOM and from Chocolate DOOM and is licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 2. See programs/doom/COPYING for
the full text and programs/doom/README.md for provenance.

The emulator does not link against the DOOM code: DOOM is cross-compiled to a
RISC-V ELF and executed as guest data. The two are separate programs that
happen to be distributed together.
